# Cloudflare Pages _redirects file
# Processed by Cloudflare CDN — 301/302 redirects with zero CPU usage.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Format: <source> <destination> <status_code>
#
# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║ CRITICAL: Non-www → www redirect CANNOT be done in this file!       ║
# ║ Cloudflare Pages _redirects only handles PATH-based rules.          ║
# ║ Non-www → www is a HOSTNAME redirect, handled in the CF Dashboard:  ║
# ║   Dashboard → Rules → Redirect Rules → Create Rule                  ║
# ║   When: Hostname equals "kolkatacabservice.com"                     ║
# ║   Then: https://www.kolkatacabservice.com${uri.path} [301]          ║
# ║ Also enable: SSL/TLS → Edge Certificates → Always Use HTTPS: ON     ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
#
# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║ IMPORTANT NOTE FOR STATIC SITES:                                    ║
# ║ Cloudflare Pages serves pre-built static HTML files BEFORE          ║
# ║ evaluating _redirects rules. This means if /routes/kolkata-to-      ║
# ║ ranchi/suv.html exists as a static file, _redirects rules for       ║
# ║ /routes/*/suv will NOT fire — the static file is served instead.    ║
# ║ TO OVERRIDE: Use Cloudflare Dashboard → Rules → Redirect Rules      ║
# ║ with a regex rule (see SEO fix plan for exact instructions).        ║
# ║ The X-Robots-Tag: noindex in _headers WILL still apply though.     ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# sitemap_index.xml → sitemap.xml (301 permanent)
/sitemap_index.xml /sitemap.xml 301

# ── PRIORITY: Vehicle sub-page variants → canonical route page ───────────────
# These redirect rules appear FIRST so they match before other rules.
# For pre-built static pages, also create a Cloudflare Redirect Rule in
# Dashboard → Rules → Redirect Rules (see SEO plan for exact regex).
/routes/*/sedan     /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/suv       /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/tempo     /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/luxury    /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/innova    /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/crysta    /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/dzire     /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/ertiga    /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/traveller /routes/:splat 301

# Vehicle sub-page trailing slash variants
/routes/*/sedan/    /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/suv/      /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/tempo/    /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/luxury/   /routes/:splat 301
/routes/*/innova/   /routes/:splat 301

/route/* /routes/:splat 301
/service/* /services/:splat 301

